Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位智者曾告诉我「家人不止于血亲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise man once told me, "Family don't end in blood."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是欧洲最古老的家族之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Europe's oldest families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家族是弗兰肯斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house of… Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有血缘也不一定是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't start there, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得以成功的秘诀就是保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole key to our success is secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family cares about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩认为该隐血印就是他的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean thinks the mark of Cain is his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是关心你能为他们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what you can do for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如今已经不是王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no king, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're their bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论好坏 家人会一直陪在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family's there through the good, bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,书一直都在你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you had the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 当着我的面撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean … - Lied right to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还把小卡牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you pulled Cass into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,协议依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agreement stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我哥哥找到治愈办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me a cure for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会杀死克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll kill crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会支持你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got your back…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:41.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（匹配）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论艰难险阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁想要什么 你立刻给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give whoever that is whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:47.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发送）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.41,0:00:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:56.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:00.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯戴恩堂 始建于1915年）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你开着 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路易斯安那州 什里夫波特）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯戴恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Styne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和伙计们打了个赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my boys… we got a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有多处\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much of a virgin are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一看就是还没破处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you ain't never got laid before, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是见过咪咪的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you seen a boob, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.74,Title,0,0,0,0,,而且不是在《权力的游戏》上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean on "Game of Thrones."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说见过活生生的没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about in the wild, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.11,0:01:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我像说相声的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look like a comedian to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去像那种喜欢装狠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like the kind of dude who wants people to think he's hood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百块的发型 混合动力车的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the $100 haircut, the hybrid keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你从小娇生惯养\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you grew up in a white-bread wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸大概是牙医 你妈妈打满了肉毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's probably a dentist, your mom's mostly botox,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且两人都跟泳池清理工上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they both bang the pool boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你喜欢说唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you like rap,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但又害怕黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're scared of black people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括史皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}even Will Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好狠啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小贱人 嘴巴挺厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got a mouth on you, little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There a problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问你 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't asking you, dick bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞 有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cy, we got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,樱桃味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherry berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我跟你无冤无仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, man, I got no beef with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢动我家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put hands on my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你也要放手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? You gonna let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie. I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想念你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm so sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害死了她 你没资格道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got her killed. You don't get to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你别去管了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你死掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印不会害死我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark isn't gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等血印折磨完你 你就不再是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's done with you, you won't be you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你是我的一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you're all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然要为你拼一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, of course I was gonna fight for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I had a shot…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你有个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you had a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna forgive myself for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我怎么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得该死的是你 不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it should be you up there… not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟小卡捣鼓那书的事 到此结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing with Cass and the book ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再捣鼓出另一条人命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down before somebody else gets hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到做这事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna find whoever did this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna rip apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人爱过的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything and everyone that they've ever loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再扯出那人的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna tear out their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的想法 还是血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you talking or the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你还来洛杉矶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you still coming to L.A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能吧 就是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope so. It's just my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们知道我要搬走 会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they found out I was moving, they'd kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真的会杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人很奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My folks are, like, weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 你没拿到书\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as I understand, you didn't get the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还丢了条胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you lost an arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不算获胜 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I call a win, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们怎么处置失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what we do to losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我给您带来份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I brought you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一个令人难以置信的魔法宝库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a stash of magic like you wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟把我带去了他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters dragged me to their…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,会所\N{\fnArial\fs30}clubhouse…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里全是传说书籍 古物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's filled with folklore, artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,可能《诅咒之书》也在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe even "The Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,您给我几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you give me a few guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿回家族历史上最多的战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll make the biggest score this family's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你需要条新手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need a new arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是个特别的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莱把你遭遇的口角跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eli told me about your little scuffle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这正是给他上一课的好机会啊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well, now, this… this is a teachable moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 他这样的人…渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, men like him… well, trash like him…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:08:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只有一种用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they're only good for one thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,做零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna carve him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's not what…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want to… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 那是你该继承的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that… it's your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能背叛这个家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not turn your back on this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直是个心软的孩子 塞勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've always been soft, Cyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你年纪最小 这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're the baby. It's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那要到此结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你把他切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, either you're gonna do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna butcher that boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就要把你摆在桌上开工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna put you up on the table and go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你真实的身份 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is who you are, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁迪 我刚刚给你发了一辆黑色轿车的监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudy, I just sent you some security-cam footage of a black sedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我查一下车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to run the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞 稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can do. Just give me a sec here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆注册在埃尔登·斯戴恩名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the v-vehicle's registered to Eldon Styne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路易斯安那州 什里夫波特\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of Shreveport, Louisiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有街道地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's no street address.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙有什么秘密吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy got something to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后跟你说 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fill you in later. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 客气 但这事通常不是萨姆来干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, s-sure, but isn't that what Sam's for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再盯着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉 你太迷人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You're just fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不肯上天堂的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel that rejected heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直像是想飞的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like a fish that wants to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是自以为是人的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a dog that thinks he's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟人很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm a lot like people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续骗自己吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep telling yourself that, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, about bloody time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.01,0:11:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该去追她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have gone after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:11:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族 他们找到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Stynes… uh, they caught up with her, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩去找他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's going after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要停下这项工作 我答应迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shutting this down. I promised Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想来告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone want to tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想 - 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意杀了她 她刚刚还说我是鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to kill her. She just called me a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该能追踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh… we should be able to track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几周前给宝贝车装了追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I low-jacked the impala a few weeks back just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:56.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查理发来的新邮件）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆 没法多说 下载文件）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:06.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载附件 为了迪恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我想的那样东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她破解了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cracked the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,你用这个能读懂《诅咒之书》了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read "The Book of the Damned" with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以解除该隐血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can cure the Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 去找到迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, go find Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他不会太失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure he doesn't go too far off the reservation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要救我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟迪恩说 - 我知道我说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You told Dean… - I know what I told Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:14:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾是破碎 害怕 孤独的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been the one out there messed up and scared and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 他拼尽全力救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Dean… - He did whatever he could to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都成习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's become his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.05,0:14:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我欠他的 我欠他一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe him this. I owe him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他假装他能控制血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know he pretends that he can ride the mark out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真相是如何 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you and I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道如果不治好他会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what happens if we don't cure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道那条路的尽头在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know where that road ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑眼 嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black eyes and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 找到他 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Find him, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢复杂的情节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, I do love a bit of intrigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 少说话 多翻译 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Less talk, more translating. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我能看懂书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I can read the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we did, we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该履行你的承诺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's time you held up your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my son…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等你… - 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After… - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我施了咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I cast the spell…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是需要我才能施咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you need me to cast that spell…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道会怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥就是颗定时炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's a walking freaking time bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the clock, she's a-ticking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你去杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you will kill my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就给我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will do it my way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in the old country,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是得吃下第一颗心脏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd make you eat your first heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们现在文明多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to think we're a little more civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,合适吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it fit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:21.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到路易斯安那州 什里夫波特）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.93,0:16:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾照和行驶证\N{\fnArial\fs30}License and reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾什利·J·威廉姆斯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley J. Williams, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我艾什就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you can call me Ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下车 艾什利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, out of the car, Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没超速啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't speeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没喝酒…基本没喝吧 怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sober… mostly sober… so what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,后灯不亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blinker's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有违交规\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两个后灯都不亮 - 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two blinkers out. - You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还企图袭警\N{\fnArial\fs30}And attempted assault of a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要带你去警局了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're taking you down to the station, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的小子 呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I ain't your boy, cletus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就是 你还是乖乖的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now you are, so you best settle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就别指望打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're gonna get an ass-whuppin'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我揍你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯咖啡简直是最棒的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the best cup of coffee I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我自己烤的咖啡豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Roast the beans myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在厄瓜多尔住的时候学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learned how to do it when I was living down in Ecuador.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去过厄瓜多尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been to Ecuador?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,会做汉堡去哪都能找到工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can fry up a decent burger, you can get work anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别想去亚洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm dying to head to Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a dream, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是做实现梦想的生意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the business of making dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要你帮忙 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need your help. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:31.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不是小鹿 来见我 堪萨斯州 肯考迪亚 雪松街11979号 邮编66901）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥兹·奥斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ozzy Osbourne,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱米·凯尔密斯特 弗莱迪·莫克瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lemmy Kilmister, Freddy Mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟我说你是专业人士了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they said you were a pro, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题我来问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask the questions here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 你有17张假身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, for example, you got 17 fake I.D.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,后备箱里全是枪支 刀具 和忍者镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a trunk full of guns, knives, freaking ninja stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who are you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是马上要离开这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy that's gonna get out of here in about…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再有30秒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开67年的英帕拉 跟你说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was driving a '67 impala, just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟谁说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你打我宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is for my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟谁说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were you talking to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,门罗·斯戴恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monroe Styne.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说如果我看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said if I saw you, I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to bring you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后打给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,门罗 跟埃尔登有什么关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monroe. Any relation to Eldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,父子\N{\fnArial\fs30}His daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能去惹斯戴恩家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you can't take on the Stynes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小镇都是他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They own this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这里像神一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're practically gods around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我专杀神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I kill gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼陷阱子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's trap bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shooting me from behind…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是你 也太不像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor form, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩在哪 - 不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Dean? - Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是只聪明的喵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, aren't you a clever kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你这么干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know you're doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么问 是因为 我和你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ask because your brother and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可是好哥们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are such close friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩得到该隐血印就是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the reason Dean has the Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的一切一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that's happening… all of this…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've had this coming for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.70,0:22:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我怕那根牙签吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm frightened of that toothpick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hex bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫我告诉你 她真该拿你换那三头猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said to tell you she should have taken the three pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临寒舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my humble abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:23:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是有脑子的那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然跟我妈妈合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真信任她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不 完全不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.05,0:24:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有你什么把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has she got over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.72,0:24:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能赶紧死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you just die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的回报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.35,0:24:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做好人 就这个回报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I get for trying to be the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.56,0:24:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.72,0:24:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're the good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.38,0:24:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我这一年都在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what I've been at for the past year?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地狱做出了怎样的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The changes I made to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你指望我觉得你厉害吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I supposed to be impressed by that? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.08,0:24:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did better…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.70,0:24:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许又能有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might actually feel something again…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.17,0:25:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that it might matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.29,0:25:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.12,0:25:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都忘记了你做过的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}forgot about all the bad you've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼看你杀过人 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have watched you kill people, Crowley…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent people,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎 爱过的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people I cared about, people I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你有口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, you… you have the accent and the…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,西装革履 谈笑风生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the suit and the snark,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说到底 你就是个禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at the end of it, you are a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.23,0:25:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他人没什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like all the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.07,0:25:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看着你惨叫着死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna watch you die screaming,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.27,0:25:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他那些人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like all the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干过坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've done bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.49,0:25:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过你无法想象的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done things you can't even imagine…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕 邪恶 肮脏的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible, evil, messy things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.55,0:26:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've loved…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那每一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}every…damn…minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thank you, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我记起了我究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}for reminding me who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.21,0:26:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.55,0:26:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了别的恶魔一定好使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have worked on any other demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要弹一下手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snap my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直再简单不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easiest thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后 我要你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here on, I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.73,0:27:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之所以还活着 是因为我恩准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the only reason you're alive is because I allowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去给我捎个话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to deliver a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.76,0:27:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那个红发婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell that ginger whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.38,0:27:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过她机会一走了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I gave her a chance to walk away,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她却唾弃我的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she spat in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.87,0:27:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.85,0:27:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她绝不会料到我的致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll never see me coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, mornin', sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.02,0:28:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,门罗·斯戴恩 幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monroe Styne. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.15,0:28:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想跟你握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd shake your hand, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 你的确了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have to say I am impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么举着枪冲了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you charged in here all guns blazin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.26,0:28:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是出好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buy tickets to that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真以为这有用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think that was really gonna work, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.69,0:28:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般是没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道接下来会怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, I guess you know what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.87,0:28:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要玩「手术游戏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna play "Operation."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.87,0:28:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my favorite game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.63,0:28:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, son, we are…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了讨价还价的阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are past the bargaining stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.66,0:29:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.94,0:29:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手臂上的血印会保证我死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark on my arm means that I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.22,0:29:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在讨价还价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not bargaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.10,0:29:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我 我还会复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flatline me, I will come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.37,0:29:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就不是人 而是恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll come back with black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们都会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们放了你 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll let you go, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.83,0:29:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就乖乖走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just mosey on down the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.71,0:29:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少我还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will be human,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.61,0:29:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们也许还能活下来几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe a few of you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.25,0:29:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.96,0:29:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话说得有理 希望你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a compelling case, and, uh, I-I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一个不会死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a man that doesn't die,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.95,0:29:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是绝佳的小白鼠啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, now, that is a perfect lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.88,0:29:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.60,0:29:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他切开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's crack this piñata.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.17,0:30:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从我身边夺走了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took someone from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.23,0:30:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要夺走你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna take everything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.34,0:30:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.99,0:30:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家 你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your home… your family…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.25,0:30:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they…will…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.72,0:31:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.15,0:31:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有看起来有点意思的都带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take whatever looks interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.99,0:31:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的都烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And burn the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.42,0:31:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我的那个魔力满满的巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that juiced-up hex bag you gave me …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:32:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力把它烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley set it on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你并没有自己想的那么强悍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're not as tough as you thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.63,0:32:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是困住他了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but you still have him trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.11,0:32:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do, Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.48,0:32:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定能想出办法来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure you'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.37,0:32:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你有个任务要完成 萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You've got a job to do, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.05,0:32:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去完成它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.29,0:32:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.97,0:32:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.29,0:32:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到他了吗 - 还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you find him? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.14,0:32:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…我在路易斯安那州的斯戴恩庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm … I'm at the Styne estate in Louisiana,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.52,0:32:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dean was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.53,0:32:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.65,0:32:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.34,0:32:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.28,0:32:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有三具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are three bodies down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.56,0:32:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上主屋里有十几具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more than a dozen upstairs in the main house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.22,0:32:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed…he killed everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.59,0:32:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brutally.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.43,0:32:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.28,0:32:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不必了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't bother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:32:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS显示他往北走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The GPS says he's headed north.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.44,0:33:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.88,0:33:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿可不是图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a damn library.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许读\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能装起来或者烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Box it or burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.95,0:33:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.00,0:33:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是你第一次出任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is your first rodeo,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是拿出点样子来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but man up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.22,0:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看看他们的性爱地牢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna go check out their sex dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.60,0:33:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里搞定这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here and finish up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.54,0:33:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.66,0:34:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我了解 迪恩·温彻斯特这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is what I know about Dean Winchester…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.66,0:34:13.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩托党）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.06,0:34:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对音乐的品味很差…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got crappy taste in music…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.21,0:34:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈很性感…\N{\fnArial\fs30}got a hot mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.90,0:34:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢法兰绒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he loves flannel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们点火烧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's light her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.54,0:34:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔登 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eldon, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.72,0:34:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没必要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.95,0:34:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Cy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.06,0:35:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roscoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.45,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.99,0:35:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你带了棉花糖来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you brought marshmallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.28,0:35:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.11,0:35:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.38,0:35:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会还在为她心痛吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not still sore about, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.76,0:35:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.36,0:35:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.27,0:35:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.62,0:35:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got what she deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.57,0:35:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我是怎么杀她的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know how I did her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.79,0:35:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算是个有趣的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a kind of funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.58,0:35:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.10,0:36:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就直接开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight to it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.10,0:36:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 之前算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you got lucky before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.81,0:36:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好要使使新装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sporting some new upgrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.16,0:36:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, my old man …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.98,0:36:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old man's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.46,0:36:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全家都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.24,0:36:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你省省那套说辞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can save me the speech on the, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.99,0:36:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么三个心 两个脾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hearts, the two spleens,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.34,0:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个乳头 好伺候女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the seven nipples, for the ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.73,0:36:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会看扁你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.34,0:36:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但即使这样 你也只有一个大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even with all that, you still only have one brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.19,0:36:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.32,0:36:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no! Don't! Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.54,0:36:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么 你也是他们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? You're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm not, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.43,0:37:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.83,0:37:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我没有缝线\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Look. No stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.34,0:37:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 我和他们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like them, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.32,0:37:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you are like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.96,0:37:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内也有邪恶 在你血液之中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's bad in you. It's in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.71,0:37:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以否认 可以逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can deny it, and you can run from it all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.38,0:37:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.85,0:37:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会战胜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会听你的话 好吗 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything you want, okay? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.19,0:37:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.63,0:37:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.52,0:37:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.62,0:38:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.83,0:38:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:24.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（堪萨斯州 黎巴嫩 40英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.73,0:38:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.98,0:38:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解决了一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took down a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.57,0:38:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.25,0:38:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续这么做直到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will continue to do that until…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.89,0:38:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你变成怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you become the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.54,0:38:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can leave now, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.96,0:38:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.84,0:38:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me ask you something …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:38:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耍你所有的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screw over all your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.08,0:38:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和我是想治好你 现在一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and I were trying to cure you. We still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.97,0:39:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在可以读懂那书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can read the book now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.25,0:39:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.79,0:39:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许能找到一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you might find a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.56,0:39:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能把这玩意从我胳膊上除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might take this crap off my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你们做到了 那代价呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, even if you do, what's it gonna cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.94,0:39:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那样的魔法必是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause magic like that does not come free.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.92,0:39:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有血淋淋的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it comes with a price that you pay in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.16,0:39:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以谢了 但不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks, but I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.24,0:39:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以抵抗血印好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could fight the mark for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.61,0:39:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能像该隐一样坚持几个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe centuries, like Cain did,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.81,0:39:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能永远和它抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you cannot fight it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.44,0:39:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你最终转变时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you finally turn …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会转变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will turn …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.99,0:39:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和所有你认识 你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone you know, everyone you love …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.26,0:39:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be long dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.63,0:39:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.13,0:39:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将不得不看着你涂炭生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who will have to watch you murder the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.83,0:39:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以即使有一个非常小的机会能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if there's even a small chance that we can save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:40:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会让你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you walk out of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.26,0:40:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.51,0:40:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得血印在改变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the mark is changing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.32,0:40:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你错了 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're wrong. - Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.21,0:40:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我认识的迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the Dean Winchester I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.95,0:40:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不可能杀死那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}would never have murdered that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.30,0:40:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.44,0:40:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个迪恩一直挺混蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Dean's always been kind of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.86,0:40:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想迫不得已伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to have to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.92,0:40:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.02,0:40:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.63,0:40:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.85,0:41:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.05,0:41:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.49,0:41:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.22,0:41:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sam stay the hell away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.66,0:41:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 就不会偏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, I won't miss.
